# Internal-only material (pricing, COGS, GTM, open-vuln working notes).
# This is the private home enforced by the confidentiality guard:
# scripts/security/scan-internal-content.mjs — see docs/security/CONFIDENTIALITY_POLICY.md.
# Files here stay on disk / in the private mirror but never enter the public tree.
internal/

# Confidential security audit + threat-model corpora (CONFIDENTIAL — share out-of-band,
# never publish to this public repo). Same policy as internal/ above: local/private-mirror
# only. The multi-model audit output, the Cure53 threat-model package, and the MDASH scan
# describe unfixed vulnerabilities; committing them here would publish the full attack map.
# See docs/security/CONFIDENTIALITY_POLICY.md and docs/security/PUBLIC_REPO_HISTORY_PURGE_RUNBOOK.md.
# (The sanitized, intentionally-public doc is docs/security/BurnBar-threat-model.md, not these.)
security-audit/
SECURITY_AUDIT_*.md
security/audit*/
security/audit-remediation-*/
security/remediation/
security/threat-model/
security/threat-model.bak-*/
security/mdash-*.md
security/evidence/*.json

